<title>UK: Brent programme equiv 38.4 cargoes in June.</title>
<headline>Brent programme equiv 38.4 cargoes in June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The June North Sea Brent crude oil loading programme has been set at the equivalent of 38.4 cargoes, made up of 34 full cargoes of 500,000 barrels and a further 2.189 million barrels in top-ups, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The May programme had scheduled 39 full cargoes plus 1.43 million barrels in top-ups.</p>
</text>
